# `git diff --cached --check` in .husky/pre-commit refuses trailing whitespace
# and conflict markers in a staged hunk. The mirrors of the live X9 scripts and
# the frozen calibration fixture are byte-for-byte copies of something else,
# so a whitespace finding there is a fact about the source, never a defect to
# fix in the copy -- fixing it IS the drift test_staging_in_sync.sh catches.
staging/**        -whitespace
tests/fixtures/** -whitespace
